From 26da99fa452210449910d62fe6d7c505781e985f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 01:53:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(web): strip avatar payloads and open last session first

Keep /api/hermes/profiles and /api/auth/me off the 500KB+ dataUrl path
by serving images from dedicated authenticated URLs. Open the stored
session immediately on chat mount so the latest 20 messages do not wait
for the full session list.
